text:
This looks like scrambled egg whites, possibly 3-4 egg whites' worth, though it could also be a crumbled white cheese. The pile fills a good part of a square plate. I estimate about 150 g. Egg whites run about 52 kcal per 100 g, so 150 g is roughly 78 kcal.

If it were feta-style cheese, the same mass would be much higher in energy. The fluffy, cooked texture points to egg whites.

